      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, what? a goblin proverb? i have no idea what you're talking about. can we just stick to the farming stuff please? i'm really confused. you mentioned something about the compost not breaking down right—can you explain the science of why that happens or how it would affect the nitrogen availability in my soil?",
      "source": "evaluator"
